{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人車婉婉、歐瑞偉及何依婷等於銅鑼灣為TVB處境劇《愛‧回家之三代同糖》宣傳，歐瑞偉將於明天一集登場，剛好與同日首播的HOY處境劇正面對撼，但他與《愛》劇主將車婉婉避談相關話題；</p><p>至於何依婷則指為擁抱戲「加料」，看來眾人對此戰均不敢怠慢！</p><p>&amp;l</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T13:41:55.916521+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T13:32:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T13:38:08.893446+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T13:38:08.893446+00:00","content_hash":"e162b75a2a5cb49a14091d6ca94d90ebc2ef84887b2df70ea23879842afea07c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}